# RIMSHIRE: while a shot rolls, a foe struck by one of your disks takes
# that disk's melee, and two foes knocked together take 1 each. The shooter
# and its friends are never hurt.
game rimshire
cheat war 1
cheat cpu 1 -1
cheat army 0 SS
cheat army 1 SS
cheat battle 6 1 0
cheat field 0
cheat unshuffle
cheat place 0 100 128
cheat place 1 100 20
cheat place 2 160 128
cheat place 3 200 128
waituntil bphase == 1 200
press A
expect sel == 0
hold RIGHT 40
hold A 40
wait 1
waituntil moving == 0 600
expect d2_hp == 3
expect d3_hp == 4
expect combo == 2
expect d0_hp == 5
expect hits == 3
